SUMMARY:Lake Lure Pontoon Boat Tour ~ Lunch at Riverwatch Bar & Grill Afte
 rwards!
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The Lake Lure boat tour is a guide
 d tour of Lake Lure with a skipper. The pontoon boat has a covered top so 
 you will be protected from the sun. Each boat holds a maximum of 20 people
 . For safety there are life jackets for each person.**\n\n**This is such a
  fun tour! Every time I have guests out of town I take them on the boat to
 ur. They loved it! You will\, too! ❤️**\n\n**I made our meetup during 
 the week for it would be nearly impossible to get all of us on two boats o
 n the weekend. The Lake Lure boat tour is very popular\, and especially no
 w that the lake has reopened.**\n\n**COST: Seniors ~ (62+) $22**\n**Adults
  ~ $24**\n*******NOTE: Since we are a group of over 10 adults our cost (gr
 oup rate) will now be $17 per person despite age. 😃**\n\n**BOAT TOUR: T
 his is a one hour tour. Our boat departs promptly at 11:00 AM. Please be a
 t the Lake Lure Beach House (2724 Memorial Hwy.\, Lake Lure\, N.C. 28746) 
 at least by 10:30 AM to pay for the tour or to use the restrooms. Please k
 eep in mind the skipper will NOT wait on late arrivals.**\n\n**WEBSITE: Fo
 r more info. please go to www.lakeluretours.com.**\n\n**For those who woul
 d like to dine at the Riverwatch Bar & Grill in Chimney Rock (right down t
 he road) after we finish our boat tour please RSVP on the separate meetup.
  And if you wish to skip the boat tour and just join us for lunch that’s
  fine\, too! We will have reservations.**\n**So come join me! It will be a
  fun tour with the skipper narrating about the changes in the lake since H
 urricane Helene.**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n*
 *(828)699-8180 (Text or call)**
