SUMMARY:Riverwatch Waterfront Bar & Grill 🍔 🍺 (Meetup after Boat Tou
 r)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The Riverwatch Bar & Grill has a b
 eautiful view and is located right on the river walk in Chimney Rock ~~ no
 t far from the Lake Lure Marina.**\n\n**This will be a good place to grab 
 a bite to eat after our boat tour. I have made reservations for us to eat 
 outside on the terrace.**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE: They offer craft beers\, burg
 ers\, etc. 🍺 🍔 To check out their menu and all they have to offer pl
 ease go to: www.riverwatchgrill.com.**\n\n**Please RSVP separately for the
  restaurant and boat tour. Thanks!**\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol
 .com**\n**(828)699-8180 (Text or Call)**
